+    /// `BGRA8Unorm`, `ARGB8Unorm`, and the alpha of the 8-bit sRGB formats), recorded as
+    /// `PrecisionNote::DeviceColorConversion`. At most one code off Metal's near a tie.
+    DeviceUnorm8,
+    /// `DeviceUnorm8`, and the device's sRGB encode for the 8-bit sRGB formats' color channels.
+    DeviceUnorm8Srgb,
+}
